# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party asset packs. These are commercial or otherwise non-redistributable
# and must be acquired separately -- see docs/SETUP.md. Never commit them.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/[Aa]ssets/(HDRP)*
/[Aa]ssets/GrassFlowers
/[Aa]ssets/Realistic Tree
/[Aa]ssets/RP_Character
/[Aa]ssets/TerrainSampleAssets

# Textures derived from Renderpeople scans. Derivative works of a commercial
# licence -- regenerate locally, never commit. See docs/SETUP.md.
/[Aa]ssets/Materials/Modified_Textures/rp_*.png
/[Aa]ssets/Materials/Modified_Textures/rp_*.png.meta

# URDF-Importer output for the Toyota HSR. The source meshes are CC BY-NC-ND
# (NoDerivatives), so importer-generated meshes/materials/prefabs must not be
# redistributed. Regenerate locally -- see docs/SETUP.md.
/[Aa]ssets/HSR/
/[Aa]ssets/HSR.meta
/[Aa]ssets/Models/hsr_description_v2/robots/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Human-subject data. Only the de-identified release under data/ is tracked.
# Raw exports and per-participant run output stay local.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/analysis/raw_data/
/analysis/participant_configs/
/analysis/launch_scripts/
/analysis/results/
/analysis/end_question_plots/
/analysis/output/
/analysis/**/*.html

# The de-identified dataset is generated by analysis/deidentify.py and is only
# committed once the ethics/consent position is confirmed (docs/ETHICS.md).
# Until then these rules stop a local run from being committed by accident.
# To publish the dataset, delete this block and `git add -f data/`.
/data/*.csv
/data/*.txt
/data/trial_responses/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

